Z||000000||FieroLisa||05-15-2001||11:24 AM||||Well I thought I'd let you guys know... I'm completely in love, and it's for real this time..<P>He's tall, dark, and extremely handsome...He's sweet, willing, and always ready to run out and have a good time. He is always kind and understanding of when I'm having a bad day, and knows how to respect me.<P>He listens to me cry when I'm having a bad day without giving me opinions and crappy advice, and when I'm happy, he's happy.<P>I met him at school, but I'm taking him home to meet my mom this summer. I hope she likes him, since I kinda wanna keep him around    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I don't get to see him too often but I think that's gonna change over the summer...well anyway, I know you guys wanna see a pic of him, so here ya go!!!!<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.otterbein.edu/home/std/lsrlvn/brando1.jpg">   <P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.otterbein.edu/home/std/lsrlvn/brando2.jpg">   <P><BR>Ain't he cute!!!!! His name is Brando and he's the Thoroughbred I'm hopefully buying from the school. Yep that's me attempting to ride him, but I'm getting over my fear of jumping right now, so this was a major accomplishment for me!<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>        <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48495967&Sequence=0&res=high">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by FieroLisa (edited 05-15-2001).]||||reg||1
